{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12202480","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12202480","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1220248001:0":{"text":"これが……水？なんてきれいなんだ……こんなきれいな水、初めて見るぞ！","source_cn":"是……水？好干净……我从没见过这么干净的水！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54B9B2A6153BD011","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1220248002:0":{"text":"ど、どけ！オレにも飲ませろ！","source_cn":"让、让开！让我先喝一口！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F32536804E32D65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220248003:0":{"text":"や、やめろ――まだオレが飲んでるんだ！","source_cn":"不、不行——我还没喝够！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD4D0C2788C1B2DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220248004:0":{"text":"本当だ！きれいで、甘味さえ感じる！これは夢じゃないのか！？","source_cn":"竟然是真的，干净的，还带点甜味的水！我真的不是在做梦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E3DB30E75BCE8B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220248005:0":{"text":"あんた、やるじゃねえか――","source_cn":"兄弟，你——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC981309829E32414","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220248006:0":{"text":"ん？あんた、百錬工房のフーキンじゃねえか！？前に遠くからあんたの顔を見たことがある！","source_cn":"咦？你是百炼工坊的呼金？！我远远望见过你的脸！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5AF8D4E5AD44E00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220248007:0":{"text":"ああ！オ、オレも知ってるぞ！ゲップ！そうだ！フーキンだ！前に銃を直してもらったことがある！","source_cn":"啊啊，我、我也认得，嗝，是、是呼金！他还帮我修好过枪！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x682BEFA962CB13B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1220248008:1":{"text":"ああ！なんてことだ！何とお礼を言えばいいか……","source_cn":"太、太、太好了，太感谢您了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA217E58D75CFB44A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1220248009:1":{"text":"おいおい、お前さんたち、なにをごちゃごちゃ言いながら泣いてるんだ……？","source_cn":"嚯，好好的小伙子怎么说着说着就哭了呢……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2ECBA641826E9CB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1220248010:1":{"text":"酒が良くないことは分かっていたんだ！ヴァルターの奴からも何度も言われて……でも酒以外に飲む物がなくて……","source_cn":"我们也知道喝酒不好！沃尔特那家伙劝了我们好多次，但我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D3F21ED826FEF20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1220248011:1":{"text":"だから飲める水があるとなれば、もう……ゲップ！毎日グダグダに酔っぱらわずに済むぞ！","source_cn":"如果真能有水用，我们就不用再……嗝！每天醉醺醺的了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EADC363857109BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1220248012:1":{"text":"そ、そうだ！一杯ご馳走させてください！","source_cn":"要、要不，我们请您也喝一杯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2775D3AF17D3D72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1220248013:1":{"text":"是非お願いします！一番上等の酒をご馳走します！オレたちはもう絶対に酒は飲みませんが！！","source_cn":"是，我们请您喝吧，喝最贵的，我们以后绝对戒酒了！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA865CAD39AD33D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1220248014:1":{"text":"ほお！禁酒はいいことだ！その金は自分のために残しておくがいい！","source_cn":"嚯，戒酒是好事哇！你们那点钱自己留着吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x625CB13525BA7D8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1220248015:1":{"text":"ははあ！おっしゃるとおりにいたします！\nお前ら、行くぞ！家の中に隠している水道管を全部元に戻すんだ！","source_cn":"是是是，都听您的！\\n哥们几个，走，把家里的管子都找出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBED140ABB79F8B28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1220248016:0":{"text":"ほお！あいつら、いったいどれだけの水道管を盗んだんだ……？","source_cn":"嚯，这帮人到底偷了多少管子啊……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1D01922D2C1ADD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:27:1220248016":{"text":"ほお！あいつら、いったいどれだけの水道管を盗んだんだ……？","source_cn":"嚯，这帮人到底偷了多少管子啊……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1D01922D2C1ADD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1220248017:1":{"text":"感想？感想は……うーん、なんと言えばいいか……","source_cn":"感想？感想就是……唉，不知道怎么说……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x693190C776F0ED17","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"感想？感想は……うーん、なんと言えばいいか……","female":"感想？感想は……うーん、なんと言えばいいか……","variant_male_record_index":"135049","variant_female_record_index":"135050","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1220248020:1":{"text":"今日はここまでにしよう。ちょっとやらなきゃならんことがあるんだ。明日、ソニアさんのところで会おう。","source_cn":"今天就到这吧，我还有点私事要处理，明早在索尼娅办公的地方见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6670A1D36EF6A230","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1220248021:1":{"text":"じゃあな！","source_cn":"走了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD1F1DCCD8AE2642","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1220248022:0":{"text":"フーキンさん、なんだか怪しいわ。やらなきゃならないことって何かしら？","source_cn":"呼金怎么神神秘秘的，他在锈锚港还能有什么私事处理？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA8E79D4D42CB6F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:33:1220248022":{"text":"フーキンさん、なんだか怪しいわ。やらなきゃならないことって何かしら？","source_cn":"呼金怎么神神秘秘的，他在锈锚港还能有什么私事处理？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA8E79D4D42CB6F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1220248023:1":{"text":"いずれにしても明日にはソニアさんのところで会うことになっているんですから、それまで待ちましょう！","source_cn":"嗯，反正明天还会在索尼娅的办公室见面！那就等等吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22B5AAC57EF9CA7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:33:0:1":{"text":"明日になれば分かるだろう。","source_cn":"明天就知道了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x92809ABD21967AD7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"明日になれば分かるだろう。","female":"明日になれば分かるでしょう。","variant_male_record_index":"66538","variant_female_record_index":"66539","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:33:1:2":{"text":"僕も気になる。","source_cn":"我也很好奇","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDD4EF9BDCF89CC49","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"僕も気になる。","female":"私も気になるわ。","variant_male_record_index":"66540","variant_female_record_index":"66541","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:27:0:1":{"text":"一通り回った感想は？","source_cn":"转了一圈，感想如何？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x568FAC026289165F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"一通り回った感想は？","female":"一通り回った感想は？","variant_male_record_index":"66532","variant_female_record_index":"66533","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1220248018:1":{"text":"ガハハ！当然のことよ！","source_cn":"哇哈哈，一点也不意外！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4FDDB3FB1320DEDD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ガハハ！当然のことよ！","female":"ガハハ！当然のことよ！","variant_male_record_index":"135051","variant_female_record_index":"135052","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:27:1:2":{"text":"ろ過装置は適合しているようだな。","source_cn":"看来滤水装置很适配","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7C63739A823DD8AB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"ろ過装置は適合しているようだな。","female":"ろ過装置は適合しているみたいね。","variant_male_record_index":"66534","variant_female_record_index":"66535","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1220248019:1":{"text":"おいおい！ワシをからかうな！","source_cn":"嚯，别笑话我啦！还早着呢！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEFBB232F9323762A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"おいおい！ワシをからかうな！","female":"おいおい！ワシをからかうな！","variant_male_record_index":"135053","variant_female_record_index":"135054","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:27:2:3":{"text":"よっ！フーキン！最も偉大なる職人！","source_cn":"呼金，最伟大的工匠！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1C9222DA203555C0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"よっ！フーキン！最も偉大なる職人！","female":"よっ！フーキン！最も偉大なる職人！","variant_male_record_index":"66536","variant_female_record_index":"66537","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","